ictitious auditing", "text": "two checks", "mark": "two"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.54, 0.79, 1.03, 1.49, 1.66, 1.92, 2.35, 2.71, 2.83, 2.95]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The payments came from a separate claims system.", "t0": 17.79, "t1": 19.66, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "controls", "kicker": "Where the payments were recorded", "text": "Claims system", "mark": "Claims"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.45, 0.63, 0.79, 0.85, 1.16, 1.44]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Stanley Ellicott pleaded guilty to seven felony counts across two cases.", "t0": 19.88, "t1": 23.6, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "kicker": "The plea resolved two cases", "text": "seven felony counts", "mark": "seven"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.91, 1.21, 1.56, 1.68, 1.96, 2.32, 2.62, 2.92, 3.09]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The court sentenced him to three years in state prison.", "t0": 23.72, "t1": 25.96, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The court sentenced him to three years in state prison"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.76, 0.91, 1.02, 1.25, 1.48, 1.59, 1.84]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The second case involved a separate government contract.", "t0": 26.08, "t1": 28.39, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "controller", "kicker": "Separate prosecution", "text": "Community Challenge Grants", "mark": "Grants"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.62, 0.96, 1.03, 1.35, 1.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The prosecutor said he did not plead guilty to insurance fraud.", "t0": 28.51, "t1": 31.25, "shot": "plea", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "recovery", "kicker": "Plea clarified", "text": "Public corruption convictions", "mark": "corruption"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.65, 0.83, 0.91, 1.08, 1.27, 1.51, 1.86, 1.97, 2.35]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The prosecutor said all the stolen money had been frozen before arrest.", "t0": 31.47, "t1": 34.45, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "kicker": "Before arrest", "text": "Funds frozen", "mark": "frozen"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.62, 0.8, 0.95, 1.05, 1.4, 1.62, 1.73, 1.88, 2.19, 2.47]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The later grant report says all that money went back to the City.", "t0": 34.57, "t1": 37.23, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "recovery", "layout": "table", "heading": "Workers’ compensation fund", "context": "The prosecutor’s follow-up report", "rows": [{"label": "Frozen before arrest", "value": "$627,118.86"}, {"label": "Later grant report", "value": "Returned in full"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 0.61, 0.94, 1.2, 1.43, 1.58, 1.79, 1.95, 2.13, 2.22, 2.32]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The grant report leaves the deposit date open.", "t0": 37.35, "t1": 39.36, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "recovery", "kicker": "Fund deposit", "text": "Deposit date", "mark": "date"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.34, 0.67, 0.9, 1.0, 1.4, 1.61]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 39.48, "t1": 41.62, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Real claims, fictitious auditing", "b": "The plea resolved two cases", "o": "The money returned to the City"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "document"}